{"ticker":"GD","updated":"2026-11-27T22:55:22Z","profile":{"longName":"General Dynamics Corporation","shortName":"General Dynamics Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.gd.com","fullTimeEmployees":117000,"marketCap":98188484608,"trailingPE":21.386698,"forwardPE":19.15504,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.7372344,"pegRatio":2.61,"targetMeanPrice":417.96274,"targetHighPrice":480.0,"targetLowPrice":320.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.129,"earningsGrowth":0.157,"grossMargins":0.15421,"operatingMargins":0.10386,"profitMargins":0.082399994,"totalRevenue":56519999488,"beta":0.296,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":400.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":306.77,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.77},"summary":"General Dynamics Corporation operates as an aerospace and defense company worldwide. It operates through four segments: Aerospace, Marine Systems, Combat Systems, and Technologies. The Aerospace segment produces and sells business jets; and offers aircraft maintenance and repair, management, aircraft-on-ground support, customer support and custom completion services, modifications, upgrades, and lifecycle sustainment support services. The Marine Systems segment designs and builds nuclear-powered submarines, surface combatants, and auxiliary ships for the United States Navy and Jones Act ships for commercial customers, as well as provides maintenance, modernization, and lifecycle support services for navy ships; offers and program management, planning, engineering, and design support services for submarine construction programs. The Combat Systems segment manufactures land combat solutions, such as wheeled and tracked combat vehicles, Stryker wheeled combat vehicles, piranha vehicles, weapons systems, energetics and munitions, mobile bridge systems with payloads, tactical vehicles, main battle tanks, and armored vehicles; and offers modernization programs, support and sustainment services, and development programs. The Technologies segment provides information technology solutions and mission support services; mobile communication, computers, and command-and-control mission syst","summary_zh":"通用動力公司是一家全球航空航太和國防公司。它透過四個部門運作：航空航太、海洋系統、作戰系統和技術。航空航太部門生產和銷售公務機；並提供飛機維護和修理、管理、飛機地面支援、客戶支援和定製完成服務、改裝、升級和生命週期維持支援服務。海洋系統部門為美國海軍和瓊斯法案商業客戶設計和建造核動力潛艇、水面戰鬥艦和輔助艦艇，並為海軍艦艇提供維護、現代化和生命週期支援服務；為潛艇建造專案提供專案管理、規劃、工程和設計支援服務。作戰系統部門生產陸地作戰解決方案，例如輪式和履帶式作戰車輛、斯賽克輪式作戰車輛、食人魚車輛、武器系統、能量和彈藥、有效載荷移動橋接系統、戰術車輛、主戰坦克和裝甲車；並提供現代化計劃、支援和維護服務以及發展計劃。技術部門提供資訊科技解決方案和任務支援服務；行動通訊、電腦和指揮控制任務系統","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":335.0,"h":337.52,"l":331.33,"c":332.17,"v":1693100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":332.13,"h":341.02,"l":332.13,"c":341.0,"v":1622800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":337.9,"h":341.19,"l":336.31,"c":340.75,"v":1162500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":339.56,"h":341.68,"l":338.07,"c":341.05,"v":942900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":341.97,"h":345.22,"l":341.25,"c":343.62,"v":710200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":344.52,"h":347.37,"l":343.39,"c":346.5,"v":885900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":344.56,"h":347.37,"l":342.85,"c":343.43,"v":740600},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":345.22,"h":347.24,"l":343.43,"c":346.44,"v":773900},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":346.28,"h":347.32,"l":342.23,"c":342.77,"v":798300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":340.86,"h":342.0,"l":332.8,"c":332.94,"v":927300},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":333.1,"h":336.8,"l":332.24,"c":334.39,"v":839200},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":333.63,"h":338.78,"l":333.0,"c":335.5,"v":862600},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":335.93,"h":339.99,"l":327.33,"c":332.04,"v":1018300},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":332.44,"h":333.38,"l":329.51,"c":330.59,"v":787800},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":328.92,"h":332.16,"l":328.21,"c":331.15,"v":916700},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":333.0,"h":337.94,"l":331.76,"c":337.19,"v":823600},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":337.91,"h":341.77,"l":337.91,"c":340.69,"v":946500},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":341.24,"h":342.28,"l":338.09,"c":338.24,"v":1171900},{"t":"2025-10-